      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那就更不能让这些人失望了。\n首先就在春季的“天皇赏”拿下好成绩吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f6340c4862707bc7100a5dbf16a89635dd37cb457b926ba38e26da969ac0a24",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
